 * Subseries Inheritance: T50B Wi-Fi 5 Platform Blueprint (Single USB 2.0)
 * RAM Configuration: 256MB Hardware Allocation
 * Fleet Relationship Matrix:
 *  - vs VMG8623: VMG3625 drops the voice components (Data Only, No Phone LED).
